          </a>
          <a href="https://go.csmegastore.se/t/t?a=1514097163&as=2063681412&t=2&tk=1&cupa_sku=24946700&url=https://www.csmegastore.se/i/24946700/roborock-qrevo-maxv-black" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 border-2 border-border text-text-light font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-cta hover:text-cta transition-colors min-h-[44px] text-sm">CS Megastore<svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" /></svg></a>
